From: astrangedaytoday15-dev <342675337+astrangedaytoday15-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:12:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] World 3D S4: Live Map follow panel and overlay

- Live Map: "3D" on the selected player opens World 3D over the map:
  the open world's tiles round that unit (WorldFollowWindow, at most two
  loading), drawn by InstanceSceneView with Instance Watch's lighting,
  plate style and render scale; follows the unit at 30 fps from the 1 s
  positions (polled while open, whatever Auto says).
- Overlay: a marker per unit in view (followed one ringed), nameplates
  (or name labels), the selected bot's waypoint as a dashed line, and
  trails of where units have been while the view was open (WorldTrails).
- Controls: Q / E and buttons rotate, scroll and buttons zoom (30-480 yd
  round the unit), Trails toggle, Esc or x closes; picking another
  continent closes it. A unit gone from the map shown is followed to its
  continent, or the status says it is offline or in an instance.
- Tests for trails.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
